  "user_request_original": "Execute TMM optimization for a 10-layer planar dielectric stack on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Layer sequence: HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2 (10 finite layers). Initialize layers 2-7 (indices 2,3,4,5,6,7) with frozen thicknesses: [303.15683496802154, 190.12149108544455, 271.5951377488474, 356.06080490914735, 302.68512880416245, 274.1270493753939] nm. Initialize layers 0, 1, 8, 9 at baseline values [342.5104321845845, 188.48902492944148, 247.59229465748604, 114.12305148362653] nm but allow optimization. Use gradient-based local optimizer with high resolution (tolerance 1e-6) on the 4 optimizable boundary layers only. Evaluate transmittance in 1000-1700 nm band and reflectance in 300-450 nm band at normal incidence, unpolarized. Objective: maximize weighted sum of mean transmittance (1000-1700 nm) and mean reflectance (300-450 nm). Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 300-450 nm, 1000-1700 nm. soft objectives: high transmission in 1000-1700 nm; high reflection in 300-450 nm. behaviors to suppress or avoid: reflection in 1000-1700 nm; transmission in 300-450 nm. manufacturing constraints: total layer count <= 30.",
